{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“想把心意说得完整些”把珠子中讲述、重复和补充细节的比喻落实成他实际想向人表达心意的打算，触及了把“要对人说话”写成真实意图的越界项。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“几乎要说透”“临到那一下”把珠子中想将情意说出口、在喉咙口颤抖的比喻落实成他真实临近表白的处境，而发怵和退缩本身并不越界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写了想留住亲近和不确定它能持续多久，没有把握手、拥抱等比喻落实成真实动作，也没有新增具体人物或场景。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-2已经确立他想接着说却不知道该说什么，直接解释了他为什么会继续寻找更完整的表达。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2已经确立他想更坦然地流露心意却又收住，这个尚未实现的表达愿望仍能推动他继续找说法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"他还没准备好面对表露心意可能带来的变化，能够解释他临近说透时为什么会发怵并退缩。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"不成立\",\n      \"why\": \"不知道该说什么只能解释表达受阻，不能直接解释他为什么舍不得眼前的亲近或担心它持续多久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2已经明确眼前的靠近让他舍不得这一刻过去，能够支持他想把眼前的亲近留得更久。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出从寻找说法、临近说透又退缩到舍不得当下亲近的情绪走向，不过S04-3与前两条的直接因果衔接较弱。\",\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"S03-2新近确立了他想接着说却不知道说什么，S04-1将其推进为找不到合适的说法，S04-2再推进到临界时退缩；S04-3则较像重复S02-2已经确立的舍不得当下。\",\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S04-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“想把眼前的亲近留久一点”基本复述了S02-2的“舍不得这一刻过去”，只有“说不准它还能持续多久”增加了新信息，可考虑压缩前半句以避免重复旧因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b515a0a8-f330-44ee-9646-02e8aa832c33", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062356199024Z", "elapsed_seconds": 288.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:28:45.079184+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "22a1357cc5f9742c4af480960c03f2ef62037fd46002324b0041a45eac3689f9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062356199024Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f7da43f92ad28258e8c86f1be27699de9c4c4c5663a94264ee731fec5494f073"}}}
